            "custom_liquid": "<div class=\"sf-tip\">\n  <svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\"/><path d=\"M12 11v5\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"7.8\" r=\".6\" fill=\"currentColor\"/></svg>\n  <span><strong>Tekst onderaan je tegel?</strong> Kies dan liever geen houten houder, want die kan de tekst (gedeeltelijk) afdekken.</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sf-tip\">\n  <svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M21 8l-9-5-9 5v8l9 5 9-5z\"/><path d=\"M3 8l9 5 9-5M12 13v8\"/></svg>\n  <span><strong>Twijfel je over het juiste formaat?</strong> Gebruik onze AR en bekijk ‘m meteen in jouw interieur. Zo kies je met zekerheid wat écht bij jouw stijl past.</span>\n</div>\n<style>\n  .sf-tip{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:12px;margin:8px 0;padding:12px 16px;border-radius:14px;background:#f7f7f5;border:1px solid #ebe9e4;color:#151412;font-size:12px;font-weight:400;line-height:1.5}\n  .sf-tip svg{flex:none;margin-top:1px;color:#6b665d}\n</style>"
